== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Added various new sound effects:
** Set of sounds for {{e|Big Horn}} and its attacks.
** Using {{i|Mom's Box}}, {{i|Moving Box}}, {{i|Pandora's Box}}, {{i|Pause}}, {{i|Plan C}}, {{i|Portable Slot}}, {{i|R Key}}, {{i|Sharp Plug}}, {{i|Smelter}}, {{i|Telekinesis}}, {{i|The D6}}, {{i|Undefined}}, and {{i|Void}}.
** {{t|Butter!}} dropping an activated or passive item.
** Charging and firing a {{i|Monstro's Lung}} charged shot.
** Removing {{t|Tick}} with {{t|Match Stick}} or {{t|A Lighter}}.
** {{i|Rubber Cement}} tear bouncing.
** {{t|Safety Scissors}} defusing a bomb.
** {{i|Slipped Rib}} deflecting a shot.
** {{i|YO LISTEN!}} flying toward something.

=== Changes ===
* Lowered volume of the new tear falling sound.

=== Fixes ===
* Fixed the {{e|Mega Satan}} door opening without needing key pieces.
* Fixed petrified enemies giving coins.
* Fixed {{c|Tainted Keeper}} not getting coins from greed mode waves enemies.
* Fixed {{i|Aries}} being banned instead of {{i|Book of Shadows}} for {{c|Tainted Lost}}.
* Fixed a softlock in {{e|Delirium}} dailies that go through {{e|Hush}} if you miss the 30 minutes timer.
* Fixed the [[Red Redemption]] challenge where you couldn't go past the first floor.
* Fixed the {{s|Corpse}} music combat layer being out of sync.
* Fixed {{i|Delirious}} Brownie not disappearing when summoning another boss.
* Fixed {{i|Delirious}} Husk and Duke of Flies spawning hostile flies instead of friendly flies on death.

